QueryController --> AssetService
QueryController --> PortfolioService
QueryController --> SavedSimulationService
QueryController ..> AuthService : authenticate(token)
AuthTokenInterceptor ..> CurrentUserArgumentResolver : extractToken()
QueryController ..> AuthTokenInterceptor : TOKEN_KEY

' Präsentation -> Logik
AuthController --> AuthService
PortfolioController --> PortfolioService
AssetController --> AssetService
AssetController --> AssetStatisticsService
SimulationController --> SimulationService
SimulationController --> SavedSimulationService
